ot the first  time that saudi arabia makes  uh such initiatives in the past or four  years ago  we have seen what was called ending the  decisive storm and internet  replacing it with the storm of hope uh  but unfortunately that did not work we  saw also  saudi arabia supporting the hodeidah  agreement that was reached in sweden  with the  one intervention that did not work  either it seems that this time  things uh different at least from the  previous times  and one major difference is that we're  seeing this time that we are seeing  a strong political will uh on the  biden's administration that has been  openly talking about that this war  must end and uh the two parties the  houthis and the saudis  are seeing there is a serious movement  is taking place here  and this could be seen in the escalation  on the ground  by the houthis escalating and attacking  of different airports in  saudi arabia and saudi arabia also  escalating its attacks in yemen in order  to have the upper hand  and preparing for the negotiations
 

